{
  "comment": "ZS-BRAND-006 品牌命名残留门禁白名单。path 命中整文件放行；content 命中按具体匹配放行。category 仅限 必要保留/限期兼容；expires(YYYY-MM-DD) 到期未撤除即门禁失败。依据与撤除条件见 docs/06-品牌素材与命名映射.md 第 4 节。",
  "entries": [
    {
      "path": "^reference/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "隔离供体快照，原样保留是来源证据的一部分"
    },
    {
      "path": "^third_party/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "2026-09-08 导入基线清单/净化记录/历史测试汇总，证据冻结不重写"
    },
    {
      "path": "^THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES\\.md$",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "第三方来源与许可证声明（上游项目展示名为声明内容的一部分）"
    },
    {
      "path": "^services/zhongshu-core/sql/postgresql/upgrades/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "存量库改名迁移脚本需按旧名定位待迁移数据，验证查询亦引用旧名"
    },
    {
      "path": "^docs/04-",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "历史迁入报告不重写，其中的旧路径与旧名仅作历史记录"
    },
    {
      "path": "^docs/reviews/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "codex 代码评审文档，引用旧名作为缺陷描述、修复证据与复现步骤的一部分"
    },
    {
      "path": "^docs/0[1-6]-",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "治理/需求/决策/映射文档中登记并讨论旧名的正文（决策 D-03/D-04 记录、映射表本身）；hotfix-B: 移除错误 scope=content（无 content 模式），改为整文件放行"
    },
    {
      "path": "^\\.omx/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "历史规划建议稿，README 引用的内部文档"
    },
    {
      "path": "^scripts/brand/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "命名检查与迁移工具自身包含旧名匹配串"
    },
    {
      "path": "services/zhongshu-core/zszj-ui/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "未启用的上游前端模板资产（docs/06 第 4.2 节）；实际摘取启用前须按映射适配"
    },
    {
      "path": "^services/zhongshu-core/zszj-module-infra/src/main/resources/codegen/",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "模板中的上游参考链接（MyBatis 插件文档等来源说明）",
      "content": [
        "iocoder\\.cn",
        "芋艿"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^services/zhongshu-core/zszj-module-infra/src/main/resources/codegen/README\\.md$",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "codegen 门禁说明中引用的检测模式名（反引号内为模式字面量，非残留）",
      "content": [
        "`cn\\.iocoder`",
        "`yudao`",
        "`Yudao`",
        "`YUDAO`",
        "`youdao`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^(services/zhongshu-core|apps)/.*/《[^/]*》\\.md$",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游教程文档（书名号命名的上游入门教程），随源码资产保留"
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/zhongshu-miniapp/vite-plugins/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游 unibest 官方 vite 插件及其文档，随模板资产保留"
    },
    {
      "path": "\\.image/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游架构/演示说明图素材，不进入产品运行界面（docs/06 第 4.3 节）"
    },
    {
      "path": "services/zhongshu-core/\\.github/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游 CI 工作流，产品仓库不使用；随源码资产保留"
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/zhongshu-miniapp/docs/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游模板自带文档站与内部历史交接文档"
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/[^/]+/\\.(cursor|github|vscode)/",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游模板编辑器配置与 issue 模板，非产品运行内容"
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/[^/]+/README\\.md$",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "两端 README 的来源与上游说明章节",
      "content": [
        "yudao-ui-admin-vue3",
        "yudao-ui-admin-uniapp",
        "unibest",
        "iocoder\\.cn",
        "芋艿",
        "YunaiV"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/zhongshu-miniapp/package\\.json$",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游 unibest 元数据字段与仓库地址（docs/06 第 4.1 节：署名与来源元数据保留）；hotfix-B：原裸 token \"unibest\" 会庇护 package.json 内任意位置（包括 name 等产品元数据字段），现改为仅匹配 provenance 字段键、URL 与描述中的模板路径",
      "content": [
        "\"unibest-[a-z-]+\"",
        "https?://[^\\s\"'<>()]*unibest[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "uniapp/unibest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "上游署名/参考链接/issue 引用（源码注释、包元数据、LICENSE 引用）",
      "content": [
        "gitee\\.com/yudaocode/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "github\\.com/yudaocode/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "github\\.com/YunaiV/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "gitee\\.com/zhijiantianya/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "github\\.com/yudaocode$",
        "static\\.iocoder\\.cn/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "doc\\.iocoder\\.cn[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "www\\.iocoder\\.cn[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "cloud\\.iocoder\\.cn[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "iocoder\\.cn/MyBatis[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "[^\\s\"'<>()]*@iocoder\\.cn",
        "doc\\.yudao[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        " Created by 芋道源码",
        "@author\\s+芋道源码",
        "(?<!:)//[^\"'<>()]*芋道源码",
        "芋道源码\\s*[:：]",
        "芋道源码\\s*\\(",
        "芋道源码\\s+https?://",
        "-+\\s*芋道源码",
        "\\)\\s*芋道源码",
        "\\\"author\\\"\\s*:.*芋道源码",
        "example\\s*=[^)]*芋道源码",
        "name=芋道源码",
        "@芋艿",
        "芋艿（YunaiV）",
        "yuanma@zszj\\.example\\.com"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "(^|/)src/test/",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "hotfix-B：测试夹具/断言中的上游示例数据（setter、thenReturn、assertEquals、regex 赋值形态）；原位于无 path 限定的全局署名条目，使应用侧 setTitle(\"芋道源码管理平台\") 等同形态调用被庇护；现限定 src/test 路径",
      "content": [
        "set\\w+\\(.*芋道源码",
        "thenReturn\\(.*芋道源码",
        "assertEquals\\(.*芋道源码",
        "regex\\s*=.*芋道源码"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^apps/zhongshu-miniapp/(src|env)/",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "unibest 上游模板源码的官方维护注释与上游 issue 引用（来源说明）",
      "content": [
        "unibest 官方维护",
        "github\\.com/unibest-tech/[^\\s\"'<>()]*",
        "unibest 框架",
        "貌似 unibest",
        "unibest\\.tech"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^(apps/zhongshu-miniapp/|scripts/brand/|services/zhongshu-core/zszj-module-infra/src/(?:main/resources/codegen/vue3_admin_uniapp/|test/resources/codegen/vue3_admin_uniapp|test/java/cn/zszj/module/infra/service/codegen/))",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "限期兼容",
      "reason": "小程序组件/样式前缀 yd-* 为登记缩写（docs/06 第 4.3 节）；hotfix-B：补上 path 限定——原条目无 path 因而全局生效，使管理端等其他端的 yd-* 残留也被放行；现仅覆盖小程序本体、生成小程序代码的 codegen uniapp 模板及其同批夹具/断言（codegen README：模板、夹具、断言三者必须同批修改）、门禁脚本自身的模式定义；撤除条件：移动端 H5/微信构建门禁（ZS-CLIENT-005）可用后按批次替换为 zszj-* 并撤销本例外",
      "content": [
        "\\byd-[a-z]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "path": "^README.md$",
      "scope": "content",
      "category": "必要保留",
      "reason": "品牌门禁说明中引用的检测模式名（反引号内为模式字面量，非残留）",
      "content": [
        "`cn.iocoder`",
        "`cn\\.iocoder\\.yudao`",
        "`yudao`",
        "`youdao`",
        "`芋道`",
        "`unibest`",
        "`yd-`"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
